## ⚡ Key Technical Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| **No framework** | Vanilla JS keeps it lightweight, zero build tooling, instant load |
| **localStorage + IndexedDB** | Profile in localStorage (sync), large job sets in IndexedDB (async) |
| **Remotive + RemoteOK APIs** | Only CORS-enabled free APIs that work directly from browser |
| **Deep-links** for Naukri/LinkedIn | Scraping these is impossible from frontend; pre-filled URLs give same UX value |
| **pdf.js CDN** | Browser-native PDF parsing, no file upload to any server |
| **DRY principle** | `CONFIG.js` as single source of truth; `utils.js` shared everywhere; `EXPORT_COLUMNS` used by CSV+PDF |
| **Match scoring** | Weighted 4-factor algorithm (title 35%, skills 40%, location 15%, type 10%) |
| **Staggered animations** | `animation-delay: N*50ms` per card → smooth cascade reveal |

